# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Improve an SQD estimate with orbital optimization for the latest version of Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"
msgstr "Pagbutihin ang estimate ng SQD gamit ang orbital optimization para sa pinakabagong bersyon ng Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Improve an SQD estimate with orbital optimization"
msgstr "Pagbutihin ang estimate ng SQD gamit ang orbital optimization"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/optimize-orbitals.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD) approximates a ground-state energy by\n"
"diagonalizing the Hamiltonian in a fixed subspace of electronic configurations. That\n"
"estimate depends on the orbital basis in which the Hamiltonian is expressed, and\n"
"*orbital optimization* (OO) exploits this freedom to lower the energy without enlarging\n"
"the subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tinatantya ng Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD) ang ground-state energy sa pamamagitan ng\n"
"pag-diagonalize ng Hamiltonian sa isang nakapirming subspace ng mga electronic configuration. Ang\n"
"estimate na iyon ay nakadepende sa orbital basis kung saan ipinapahayag ang Hamiltonian, at\n"
"ginagamit ng *orbital optimization* (OO) ang kalayaang ito para pababain ang energy nang hindi pinalalaki\n"
"ang subspace.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide runs SQD on an $N_2$ molecule and then improves the result with orbital\n"
"optimization, using [`ffsim`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) to represent\n"
"the Hamiltonian and find the energy-minimizing orbital rotation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pinapatakbo ng gabay na ito ang SQD sa isang molecule ng $N_2$ at pagkatapos ay pinapabuti ang resulta gamit ang orbital\n"
"optimization, gamit ang [`ffsim`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) para irepresenta\n"
"ang Hamiltonian at hanapin ang orbital rotation na nagpapababa ng energy.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run SQD {#run-sqd}"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang SQD {#run-sqd}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We build the molecular integrals for $N_2$ in the molecular-orbital (MO) basis, generate\n"
"uniform random samples, and run SQD to obtain a ground-state approximation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Binubuo namin ang mga molecular integral para sa $N_2$ sa molecular-orbital (MO) basis, gumagawa\n"
"ng mga uniform na random sample, at pinapatakbo ang SQD para makakuha ng ground-state approximation.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optimize the orbitals {#optimize-the-orbitals}"
msgstr "I-optimize ang mga orbital {#optimize-the-orbitals}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Orbital optimization searches for an orbital rotation that lowers the variational energy\n"
msgstr "Naghahanap ang orbital optimization ng orbital rotation na nagpapababa sa variational energy\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"E = \\langle \\psi | \\mathcal{U}^\\dagger\\, H\\, \\mathcal{U} | \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"E = \\langle \\psi | \\mathcal{U}^\\dagger\\, H\\, \\mathcal{U} | \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"of the SQD ground-state approximation $|\\psi\\rangle$. An orbital rotation is specified by\n"
"an $N \\times N$ unitary matrix $\\mathbf{U}$ ($N$ is the number of spatial orbitals), which\n"
"acts on the many-body state through the operator\n"
msgstr ""
"ng SQD ground-state approximation na $|\\psi\\rangle$. Ang orbital rotation ay tinutukoy ng\n"
"isang $N \\times N$ na unitary matrix na $\\mathbf{U}$ ($N$ ang bilang ng mga spatial orbital), na\n"
"umaaksyon sa many-body state sa pamamagitan ng operator na\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U} = \\exp\\left[\\sum_{pq, \\sigma} \\log(\\mathbf{U})_{pq}\\, a^\\dagger_{p\\sigma} a_{q\\sigma}\\right].\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U} = \\exp\\left[\\sum_{pq, \\sigma} \\log(\\mathbf{U})_{pq}\\, a^\\dagger_{p\\sigma} a_{q\\sigma}\\right].\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`ffsim.optimize_orbitals` returns the **matrix** $\\mathbf{U}$, and applying it to the\n"
"orbital basis (via `hamiltonian.rotated`) is equivalent to applying $\\mathcal{U}$ to the\n"
"state. See the\n"
"[ffsim orbital-rotation explanation](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/explanations/orbital-rotation.html)\n"
"for details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ibinabalik ng `ffsim.optimize_orbitals` ang **matrix** na $\\mathbf{U}$, at ang pag-apply nito sa\n"
"orbital basis (sa pamamagitan ng `hamiltonian.rotated`) ay katumbas ng pag-apply ng $\\mathcal{U}$ sa\n"
"state. Tingnan ang\n"
"[paliwanag ng ffsim tungkol sa orbital-rotation](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/explanations/orbital-rotation.html)\n"
"para sa mga detalye.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Since rotating the orbitals changes the Hamiltonian seen by the subspace, we alternate\n"
"two steps until the energy stops improving:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dahil binabago ng pag-rotate ng mga orbital ang Hamiltonian na nakikita ng subspace, salitan nating ginagawa\n"
"ang dalawang hakbang hanggang tumigil ang pagbuti ng energy:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Diagonalize** the Hamiltonian in the current basis over the fixed set of\n"
"configurations.\n"
msgstr ""
"**I-diagonalize** ang Hamiltonian sa kasalukuyang basis sa ibabaw ng nakapirming hanay ng\n"
"mga configuration.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Optimize the orbitals** by finding the rotation that minimizes the energy of the\n"
"resulting state, then rotate the integrals into the new basis.\n"
msgstr ""
"**I-optimize ang mga orbital** sa pamamagitan ng paghahanap ng rotation na nagpapababa sa energy ng\n"
"nagreresultang state, pagkatapos ay i-rotate ang mga integral sa bagong basis.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We delegate the orbital-rotation step to\n"
"[`ffsim.optimize_orbitals`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/ffsim.html#ffsim.optimize_orbitals),\n"
"which finds the energy-minimizing rotation from the one- and two-body reduced density\n"
"matrices (RDMs) of the state. See\n"
"[Sec. II A 4](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.05068) for details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinapaubaya namin ang hakbang ng orbital-rotation sa\n"
"[`ffsim.optimize_orbitals`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/ffsim.html#ffsim.optimize_orbitals),\n"
"na nakakahanap ng rotation na nagpapababa ng energy mula sa one- at two-body reduced density\n"
"matrix (RDM) ng state. Tingnan ang\n"
"[Sec. II A 4](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.05068) para sa mga detalye.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why orbital optimization helps here {#why-orbital-optimization-helps-here}"
msgstr "Bakit nakakatulong dito ang orbital optimization {#why-orbital-optimization-helps-here}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SCF molecular-orbital (MO) basis is stationary with respect to orbital rotations\n"
"for the *full*-CI problem. But SQD works in a small truncated subspace (here a few\n"
"hundred CI strings out of roughly 19 million full-CI determinants), for which the MO\n"
"basis is generally not optimal, so rotating the orbitals lowers the energy the subspace\n"
"can represent.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang SCF molecular-orbital (MO) basis ay stationary kaugnay ng mga orbital rotation\n"
"sa problemang *full*-CI. Ngunit gumagana ang SQD sa isang maliit na pinutol na subspace (dito ay ilang\n"
"daang CI string mula sa humigit-kumulang 19 milyong full-CI determinant), kung saan ang MO\n"
"basis ay karaniwang hindi optimal, kaya ang pag-rotate ng mga orbital ay nagpapababa sa energy na kayang irepresenta\n"
"ng subspace.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternate diagonalization and orbital optimization {#alternate-diagonalization-and-orbital-optimization}"
msgstr "Salitan na diagonalization at orbital optimization {#alternate-diagonalization-and-orbital-optimization}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We keep the diagonalization subspace **fixed** to the configurations discovered by SQD\n"
"above, so that each iteration isolates the effect of rotating the orbitals. Each\n"
"iteration:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pinapanatili naming **nakapirmi** ang diagonalization subspace sa mga configuration na natuklasan ng SQD\n"
"sa itaas, para ihiwalay ng bawat iteration ang epekto ng pag-rotate ng mga orbital. Ang bawat\n"
"iteration ay:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Diagonalizes** the Hamiltonian over the fixed subspace in the current basis, using\n"
"PySCF's selected-CI solver.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Nagdi-diagonalize** ng Hamiltonian sa ibabaw ng nakapirming subspace sa kasalukuyang basis, gamit ang\n"
"selected-CI solver ng PySCF.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Builds the RDMs** of the resulting state, which is all `ffsim.optimize_orbitals`\n"
"needs.\n"
msgstr "**Bumubuo ng mga RDM** ng nagreresultang state, na siya lamang kailangan ng `ffsim.optimize_orbitals`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Optimizes the orbitals**: `ffsim.optimize_orbitals` returns the energy-minimizing\n"
"rotation, which we apply to the integrals to move into the improved basis.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Nag-o-optimize ng mga orbital**: ibinabalik ng `ffsim.optimize_orbitals` ang rotation na nagpapababa ng energy,\n"
"na ina-apply namin sa mga integral para lumipat sa pinahusay na basis.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We record the energy *before* each optimization step. Because the basis improves every\n"
"iteration, this sequence decreases monotonically toward the best energy achievable in\n"
"the fixed subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"Itinatala namin ang energy *bago* ang bawat hakbang ng optimization. Dahil bumubuti ang basis sa bawat\n"
"iteration, ang sequence na ito ay monotonic na bumababa patungo sa pinakamahusay na energy na makakamit sa\n"
"nakapirming subspace.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare the results {#compare-the-results}"
msgstr "Ihambing ang mga resulta {#compare-the-results}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Orbital optimization improves the fixed-subspace estimate, closing much of the gap to\n"
"the exact energy while staying above it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pinapabuti ng orbital optimization ang estimate sa nakapirming subspace, na nagpapaliit sa malaking bahagi ng agwat sa\n"
"tamang energy habang nananatiling mas mataas dito.\n"
